  "description": "<html>\n        <head>\n        \n        </head>\n        <body >\n        <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#111827; max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;\">\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:18px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#111827;\">📚 86, EIGHTY-SIX Light Novel Vol. 1–13 English Version – Brand New – FULL SET – Tracked Shipping Available</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:0; color:#374151;\">Enjoy <strong>86, EIGHTY-SIX</strong> in English with this <strong>Vol. 1–13 Full Set</strong>. This light novel set is suitable for readers, casual fans, first-time light novel buyers, sci-fi fans, military drama fans, and anyone who wants an affordable way to enjoy the story in physical print.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#fef2f2; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:16px; color:#991b1b;\">⚠️ Important Edition Notice – Please Read Before Buying</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is a <strong>local / underground / Southeast Asian market reading edition</strong>. It is made for affordable personal reading and enjoyment.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is <strong>NOT an official publisher edition</strong> and is not from Viz Media, Square Enix, Kodansha, Yen Press, Tokyopop, Vertical, or similar official producers.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This edition is <strong>not suitable for collectors</strong>. It is more suitable for first-time readers, casual readers, fans, and pleasure reading. Official editions usually cost more.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Minor print, trim, colour, paper, cover, binding, jacket, spine, book size, or finishing variations may occur between batches.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">✨ Quick Highlights</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef2ff; color:#3730a3; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Vol. 1–13</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#ecfeff; color:#155e75; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">English Version</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#f0fdf4; color:#166534; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Brand New</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#fff7ed; color:#9a3412; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Malaysia Publisher Reading Edition</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#fdf2f8; color:#9d174d; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">FULL SET</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#f9fafb; color:#374151; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Tracked Shipping Available</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📖 Story Overview</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\"><strong>86, EIGHTY-SIX</strong> is a science fiction light novel set in a divided world where young soldiers, commanders, and advanced machines are caught in a difficult conflict. The story follows characters who must face duty, trust, survival, and the meaning of humanity in a harsh system.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">As the story develops, the characters build bonds across distance and social barriers while learning more about each other’s lives, choices, and hopes. The series focuses on emotional growth, strategy, teamwork, and the strength needed to move forward.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Across Volumes 1–13, this light novel series blends military science fiction, drama, action, mecha themes, character development, and emotional storytelling, making it a strong choice for readers who enjoy thoughtful sci-fi light novels.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📌 Key Details</h3>\n    <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700; width:35%;\">Title / Series</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">86, EIGHTY-SIX</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Volumes</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Vol. 1–13</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Set Type</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FULL SET</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Language</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">English Version</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Author / Artist</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Asato Asato</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Genre</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Science Fiction, Military Drama, Action, Mecha, Light Novel</td>\n 