;\">This is a local reading edition, not an official publisher edition.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Not suitable for collectors who require official publisher copies or premium collectible finishing.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Official editions usually cost more.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Please message before buying if you are unsure about the edition, quality, or included volumes.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Please confirm the set type and volume range before purchase.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">🚚 Shipping</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Tracked shipping is available where applicable. Orders will be packed securely before dispatch.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Please make sure your shipping address is correct before placing the order.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Delivery time may vary depending on destination, courier handling, customs processing, local delivery service, and seasonal volume.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">↩️ Returns</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Returns are accepted according to the return policy shown on this eBay listing.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Item must be returned in the same condition received. Please contact us first if there is any issue with your order.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">⭐ Feedback</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Your satisfaction is important to us. If you are happy with your purchase, positive feedbac